  "claims_to_verify": [
    "t.getDamage produces the scalar stored as trap self.dam, and the trigger passes that same self.dam to the FIREBURN projector.",
    "The trigger uses ball geometry with exact radius 2 and skips the summoner.",
    "Scalar FIREBURN defaults to duration 3 and initial 50: half is immediate FIRE and the remaining half is divided across three BURNING timeouts.",
    "An existing BURNING effect causes remaining damage to be pooled and duration/power to be recomputed, so the isolated three-tick schedule is qualified by merge.",
    "Both %0.2f placeholders bind damDesc(FIRE, t.getDamage); the full target's %s binds only the optional primed-trigger suffix.",
    "Only the short target's 范围 2 is repaired to 半径 2; the full target and all adjacent trap entries remain byte-identical."
